# Private host keys stay out of version control.  This repository is
# replicated to GitHub, and a published host key lets anyone impersonate
# the board to an ssh client that has trusted it.  Regenerate with:
#
#   dropbearkey -t ed25519 -f dropbear_ed25519_host_key
#   dropbearkey -t rsa -s 2048 -f dropbear_rsa_host_key
#
# Without them dropbear still works -- it generates a key at first boot,
# which is what we had before, so a fresh clone degrades rather than breaks.
dropbear_*_host_key
